<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 91-5 AT TEA VS SOUTH AFRICA IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 91-5 AT TEA VS SOUTH AFRICA IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>AHMEDABAD, India 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 91 for five at tea in their second innings on the third day of the first cricket test against South Africa on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 223 and 91-5, South Africa 244.</p>
</text>
